        "raw_sha256": "a25a22b9cd9ae7aedf3db7d1e4e34d0d7ab690032193eeaff4165660040aa246",
        "source_projection_item_number": 11
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68456d2f0000000023013fe8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-15:u12",
      "position": 12,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "4. 节奏把控，后续引导：",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68456d2f0000000023013fe8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "0e9c92c65e5667a27c50eafa3f2869592924e80b9fba480f643e6a86e09b4697",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68456d2f0000000023013fe8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "a25a22b9cd9ae7aedf3db7d1e4e34d0d7ab690032193eeaff4165660040aa246",
        "source_projection_item_number": 12
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68456d2f0000000023013fe8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-15:u13",
      "position": 13,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "-自我介绍可以带点抛砖引玉的成分，埋下钩子，吸引面试官继续深入追问你熟悉的方向。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68456d2f0000000023013fe8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "0e9c92c65e5667a27c50eafa3f2869592924e80b9fba480f643e6a86e09b4697",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68456d2f0000000023013fe8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "a25a22b9cd9ae7aedf3db7d1e4e34d0d7ab690032193eeaff4165660040aa246",
        "source_projection_item_number": 13
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68456d2f0000000023013fe8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-15:u14",
      "position": 14,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "举个例子：你可以主动说：\"如果您感兴趣，我也可以详细聊聊我们在做高并发限流时遇到的一些问题和解决方案，也可以聊下我在 JVM 层面的调优实践。\"或者\"我对我们系统模块都比较熟悉，主要看您对哪块比较感兴趣，我可以给您介绍一下。（提前准备系统模块交互的介绍，以及系统在上下游的定位）\"",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68456d2f0000000023013fe8.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "0e9c92c65e5667a27c50eafa3f2869592924e80b9fba480f643e6a86e09b4697",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68456d2f0000000023013fe8.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "a25a22b9cd9ae7aedf3db7d1e4e34d0d7ab690032193eeaff4165660040aa246",
        "source_projection_item_number": 14
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68456d2f0000000023013fe8:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-15:u15",
      "position": 15,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "最后：再次提醒，不要背简历。总共时间建议控制在3分钟以内，太长了面试官会烦。#社招[话题]# #跳槽[话题]# #java面试[话题]# #后端面试[话题]# #java[话题]# #面试技巧[话题]# #校招[话题]# #面试求职[话题]# #春招[话题]#",
